buildlog.txt

We have a new operator registration API introduced in #36258, and we need to port all use sites of the old registration API to use it.
Here is the general recipe for porting:

We must add def()s of the operators to the centralized location.  For aten:: namespace, this location is the TORCH_LIBRARY(aten, m) { block in aten/src/ATen/templates/TypeDefault.cpp.  A def looks like:

m.def("aten::splitlines(str self, bool keepends=False) -> str[]");


We must translate the registrations in register_string_ops.cpp to the new registration form (staying in this file). You do this by adding a new TORCH_LIBRARY_IMPL block as such:

TORCH_LIBRARY_IMPL(aten, CatchAll, m) {
  m.impl("splitlines", [](std::string string, bool keepends) {
    // previous implementation
  });
  // ... rest of the registrations ...
}

